      "importance": 75,
      "importanceReasonZh": "该事件标志着Claude模型在主流消费平台上的重要集成，对开发者生态和AI应用普及有显著影响。",
      "importanceReasonEn": "This event marks a significant integration of Claude models on mainstream consumer platforms, with notable impact on developer ecosystem and AI app adoption.",
      "scoringMode": "ai",
      "titleZh": "在Apple平台的Foundation Models框架中构建智能应用",
      "titleEn": "Building intelligent apps for Apple platforms with Claude in the Foundation Models framework",
      "summaryZh": "Anthropic宣布Claude现已通过Apple的Foundation Models框架集成到Apple平台，开发者可以在iOS、macOS等系统中原生使用Claude模型构建智能应用。",
      "summaryEn": "Anthropic announced that Claude is now integrated into Apple platforms via Apple's Foundation Models framework, allowing developers to natively use Claude models to build intelligent apps on iOS, macOS, and more.",
      "keywords": [
        "Claude",
        "Apple",
        "Foundation Models",
        "iOS",
